2	/**
3	 * cron-weekly-runner.cjs — SessionStart hook: consolidated weekly cron tasks
4	 *
5	 * Combines 3 former weekly hooks into one sequential runner:
6	 *   1. metaLearnerWeekly  — writes ISO-week digest + Hebbian edge decay
7	 *   2. cognitiveConsolidation — launches consolidation orchestrator (detached) if >=12h or >50 new items
8	 *   3. brainRefreshWeekly — spawns brain-refresh-weekly.py (detached) if >7 days since last run
9	 *
10	 * All tasks are fail-open. Exit 0 always. Non-blocking.
